Related to #34994.

Calibrate all 193 `amd-ci` test-group timeouts from the latest 10 canonical nightly runs instead of using the blanket 180-minute value. For each group, this change:

1. takes the Buildkite wall-completion time, excluding queue wait;
2. uses the slowest shard as that night's group completion time;
3. averages builds 12460, 12447, 12440, 12414, 12394, 12380, 12360, 12347, 12343, and 12332;
4. adds 20 minutes of margin; and
5. rounds up to the next multiple of five.

## AI assistance

AI assistance was used to calculate, apply, and validate the timeout values. The methodology, generated timeout table, and changed lines should be reviewed by the human submitter before merge.
